{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2022-09-27 14:18:00', 'title': 'SENSORMATIC SOLUTIONS BY JOHNSON CONTROLS PREDICTS THE GLOBAL TOP BUSIEST SHOPPING DAYS FOR THE 2022 HOLIDAY SEASON', 'text': 'NEUHAUSEN, SWITZERLAND--(BUSINESS WIRE)--SENSORMATIC SOLUTIONS, THE LEADING GLOBAL RETAIL SOLUTIONS PORTFOLIO OF JOHNSON CONTROLS, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS PREDICTIONS FOR THE TOP BUSIEST SHOPPING DAYS OF THE 2022 HOLIDAY SEASON AROUND THE WORLD. BLACK FRIDAY (NOV. 25), THE FRIDAY BEFORE CHRISTMAS (DEC. 23) AND THE DAY AFTER CHRISTMAS (DEC. 26) ARE EXPECTED TO BE AMONG THE BUSIEST SHOPPING DAYS OF THE UNITED STATES THIS SEASON. THE ANNUAL PREDICTIONS FOR THE GLOBAL TOP BUSIEST SHOPPER TRAFFIC DAYS A'}